2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an <strong>independent musician</strong>. After a long day, you drift off to sleep\u2026 until a phone call suddenly jolts you awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your friend, panicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAre you still in there?! Tell me you made it out\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you haven\u2019t. You\u2019re still inside. And outside, there\u2019s only silence. A heavy, unnatural silence\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is lurking.</strong><br>Rumors speak of a <strong>cult</strong>, a <strong>serial killer</strong>\u2026 or worse, an <strong>unknown entity</strong>.<br>The hallways are empty, yet you feel a presence. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hide. Escape\u2026 before it\u2019s too late.</strong></p>","developers":["WorldMGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943850/header.jpg?t=1741985954","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943850/725230/93c128ed876be02b23594b1f57b1c01deb01fc71/1750891016/dash_av1.mpd?t=1720783946","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943850/725230/93c128ed876be02b23594b1f57b1c01deb01fc71/1750891016/dash_h264.mpd?t=1720783946","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2943850/725230/93c128ed876be02b23594b1f57b1c01deb01fc71/1750891016/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1720783946","id":257